===Usage notes===
* In Latin America, ''calor'' is colloquially feminine. Adjectives are affected as well. ''Hace mucha calor'' thus is equal to ''hace mucho calor''. Although its use is wide, it is proscribed by the {{w|Real Academia Española}}

